*** Epi Info AI foodborne Check Code tour
*** This bounded source exercises definitions plus Form, Page, Record, and Field events.

DefineVariables
  DEFINE ReviewState STANDARD TEXTINPUT
End-DefineVariables

Form
  Before
    ASSIGN ReviewState = "Ready"
  End-Before
  After
    ENABLE case_status
  End-After
End-Form

Page EntryPage
  Before
    DIALOG "Review the foodborne case before saving."
  End-Before
  After
    ENABLE onset_date
  End-After
End-Page

Record
  Before
    CLEAR onset_time
  End-Before
  After
    IF case_status = "Confirmed" THEN
      ASSIGN ReviewState = "Reviewed"
    ELSE
      ASSIGN ReviewState = "Pending"
    END-IF
  End-After
End-Record

Field case_status
  Before
    ENABLE case_status
  End-Before
  After
    IF case_status = "Confirmed" THEN
      SET-REQUIRED onset_date
      ENABLE onset_date
      GOTO onset_date
    ELSE
      SET-NOT-REQUIRED onset_date
    END-IF
  End-After
End-Field

Field onset_date
  After
    IF onset_date <> "" THEN
      UNHIDE onset_time
      ENABLE onset_time
    END-IF
  End-After
End-Field
